# Wave W17-AA (Route 222): panel post — a tilted solar-panel post flanking the beach road: a weathered post carrying one tilted dark panel at its head, its face catching a single glint — the design’s signature standing in the prop register (design: tilted solar panels flank the road a mile out from Brightshore; the panels themselves are the city’s, the posts mark where they begin). On solar turf (fully opaque, ground baked in) — split from the fleet’s marker posts by the panel entire: posts mark a road, this one carries the city’s light on its face.
